{"ticker":"HON","updated":"2026-10-30T22:52:12Z","profile":{"longName":"Honeywell International Inc.","shortName":"Honeywell International Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Conglomerates","country":"United States","website":"https://www.honeywell.com","fullTimeEmployees":101000,"marketCap":69197512704,"trailingPE":10.8244915,"forwardPE":22.157429,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.8333865,"pegRatio":3.09,"targetMeanPrice":253.91304,"targetHighPrice":290.0,"targetLowPrice":186.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.013,"earningsGrowth":-0.636,"grossMargins":0.3721,"operatingMargins":0.1692,"profitMargins":0.18684,"totalRevenue":37743001600,"beta":0.888,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":260.28317,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":195.86786,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.26},"summary":"Honeywell International Inc. engages in the industrial automation, building automation, and energy and sustainability solutions businesses in the United States, Europe, and internationally. The Industrial Automation segment provides automation control and instrumentation products and services; smart energy products; sensing technologies, including custom-engineered sensors and related services; gas detection technologies and personal protective equipment; and system design automation equipment, as well as software and analytics for manufacturing, distribution, and fulfillment operations. The Building Automation segment provides software applications for building control and optimization; sensors, switches, control systems, and instruments for energy management; access control; video surveillance; fire products; and installation, maintenance, and system upgrade services. The Energy and Sustainability Solutions segment, through its UOP business, delivers licensed process technology, equipment, engineering, catalysts, adsorbents, and services for refining, petrochemicals, low-carbon energy, gas and LNG, and industrial solutions, as well as connectivity, data integration, and software solutions. The company also offers Forge Cognition, a self-contained agentic AI and simulation platform for facility operations. The company was formerly known as AlliedSignal, Inc. Honeywell Internat","summary_zh":"霍尼韋爾國際公司在美國、歐洲和國際上從事工業自動化、建築自動化以及能源和永續發展解決方案業務。工業自動化部門提供自動化控制和儀器儀表產品和服務；智慧能源產品；感測技術，包括客製化設計的感測器和相關服務；氣體檢測技術和個人防護設備；和系統設計自動化設備，以及用於製造、分銷和履行營運的軟體和分析。樓宇自動化部門提供用於樓宇控制和優化的軟體應用程式；用於能源管理的感測器、開關、控制系統和儀器；存取控制；視訊監控；消防產品；以及安裝、維護和系統升級服務。能源和永續發展解決方案部門透過其 UOP 業務，為煉油、石化、低碳能源、天然氣和液化天然氣以及工業解決方案以及連接、數據整合和軟體解決方案提供許可的製程技術、設備、工程、催化劑、吸附劑和服務。該公司還提供 Forge Cognition，這是一個用於設施運營的獨立代理人工智慧和模擬平台。該公司前身為 AlliedSignal, Inc. Honeywell Internat","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"企業集團","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":214.5278,"h":215.6053,"l":212.9166,"c":215.0913,"v":3289930},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":214.6761,"h":214.7256,"l":210.1094,"c":211.5328,"v":3562674},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":211.2659,"h":213.144,"l":209.6547,"c":212.6794,"v":4709799},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":212.5015,"h":213.7964,"l":210.91,"c":211.7799,"v":4152778},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":212.3433,"h":212.7189,"l":210.0896,"c":212.2741,"v":4617030},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":212.4817,"h":212.8277,"l":209.4965,"c":211.7305,"v":2979450},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":211.5031,"h":211.8689,"l":208.943,"c":209.2593,"v":4335180},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":209.4768,"h":213.6679,"l":209.032,"c":212.8277,"v":5645588},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":211.5822,"h":212.1061,"l":208.5081,"c":209.0221,"v":3205962},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":209.3186,"h":210.4751,"l":208.2609,"c":209.2988,"v":3835924},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":209.2395,"h":210.8606,"l":208.172,"c":208.5179,"v":3378754},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":209.2296,"h":211.1868,"l":207.826,"c":209.2395,"v":5475426},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":208.6563,"h":210.9397,"l":207.6283,"c":207.7766,"v":4505545},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":208.6662,"h":208.6662,"l":205.0286,"c":206.9562,"v":11134470},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":206.3433,"h":208.1127,"l":204.9397,"c":206.5904,"v":4861448},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":207.0254,"h":